    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/extras/cebfc568124c4d44c82f8c9c1d845641.avif?t=1755703970\" data-has-big width=800 height=148 /></span>In the near future, humanity is steadily expanding into the depths of space. You are an astronaut on a routine but important mission: follow a designated route to a remote station and deliver technical data.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/extras/278b850ef283d111605279ca30578cb8.poster.avif?t=1755703970\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/extras/278b850ef283d111605279ca30578cb8.webm?t=1755703970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/extras/278b850ef283d111605279ca30578cb8.mp4?t=1755703970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Along the way, command contacts you with an additional request \u2014 retrieve documents from the research vessel <strong>&quot;Echo-7&quot;</strong>, which recently went silent. The silence is attributed to a recent geomagnetic storm disrupting communications.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/extras/e76a17834e66eeda0f79897189f19498.poster.avif?t=1755703970\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/extras/e76a17834e66eeda0f79897189f19498.webm?t=1755703970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/extras/e76a17834e66eeda0f79897189f19498.mp4?t=1755703970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As you approach Echo-7, you attempt to contact the crew \u2014 but there\u2019s no response. The ship appears functional from the outside. Inside \u2014 nothing. <br><br>No welcoming party, no signs of life. Just empty corridors, scattered personal belongings, and the unsettling feeling that you're not alone.<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa5 <strong>Realistic graphics</strong> \u2014 visual fidelity enhances the feeling of unease</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf2b\ufe0f <strong>Haunting atmosphere</strong> \u2014 silence, isolation, and growing tension follow your every step</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa7 <strong>Immersive sound</strong> \u2014 rich audio design pulls you deep into the experience</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/extras/cebfc568124c4d44c82f8c9c1d845641.avif?t=1755703970\" data-has-big width=800 height=148 /></span>In the near future, humanity is steadily expanding into the depths of space. You are an astronaut on a routine but important mission: follow a designated route to a remote station and deliver technical data.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/extras/278b850ef283d111605279ca30578cb8.poster.avif?t=1755703970\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/extras/278b850ef283d111605279ca30578cb8.webm?t=1755703970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/extras/278b850ef283d111605279ca30578cb8.mp4?t=1755703970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Along the way, command contacts you with an additional request \u2014 retrieve documents from the research vessel <strong>&quot;Echo-7&quot;</strong>, which recently went silent. The silence is attributed to a recent geomagnetic storm disrupting communications.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/extras/e76a17834e66eeda0f79897189f19498.poster.avif?t=1755703970\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/extras/e76a17834e66eeda0f79897189f19498.webm?t=1755703970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3743180/extras/e76a17834e66eeda0f79897189f19498.mp4?t=1755703970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As you approach Echo-7, you attempt to contact the crew \u2014 but there\u2019s no response. The ship appears functional from the outside. Inside \u2014 nothing. <br><br>No welcoming party, no signs of life. Just empty corridors, scattered personal belongings, and the unsettling feeling that you're not alone.<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa5 <strong>Realistic graphics</strong> \u2014 visual fidelity enhances the feeling of unease</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf2b\ufe0f <strong>Haunting atmosphere</strong> \u2014 silence, isolation, and growing tension follow your every step</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa7 <strong>Immersive sound</strong> \u2014 rich audio design pulls you deep into the experience</p>",
    "short_description": "Dire Echo is a psychological horror walking simulator that immerses players in the eerie and oppressive atmosphere of abandoned deep space.",
